      "type": "text",
      "x": 1334,
      "y": 792,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 151,
      "text": "Why this strategy wins:\n  - acquisition-friendly: giants see\n    Nucleus as feeder, not threat\n  - no data lock-in: Iceberg portability\n    removes the #1 procurement objection\n  - smaller scope: we don't build\n    distributed compute\n  - customer trust: 'if we outgrow you,\n    we can leave' -> users stay longer",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
